    "# MarketVision AI: Notebook 07 - Financial Risk Intelligence\n",
    "## Volatility Modeling, VaR/CVaR, Drawdown Analysis, and Portfolio Optimization\n",
    "\n",
    "This research notebook validates modern quantitative risk management:\n",
    "1. **Volatility Decomposition**: Annualized historical and rolling volatility.\n",
    "2. **Fat-Tail Risk Measures**: Historical VaR, Parametric Gaussian VaR, and Cornish-Fisher non-normal expansions.\n",
    "3. **Coherent Tail Risk**: Conditional Value at Risk (Expected Shortfall).\n",
    "4. **CAPM Decomposition**: Beta ($\beta$) and Jensen's Alpha ($\alpha$) relative to benchmark NIFTY 50.\n",
    "5. **Portfolio Diversification**: Covariance interaction matrix and diversification ratio."
   ]
  },
